{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Large mixed breed","breed_primary":"Large Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"My Straycation foster writes: My name is Sir Scooby and that is because I am a consummate gentleman. I am attentive, as gentle as you need and am a lap dog in a big dog body. I am great with children 10 and up and have introduced myself, calmly and with grace, one by one to families as large as five (three teens and two adults). I am so intelligent that I learned how to greet my foster mom's 78 year old mother on face time! I am fully house broken. I am all man, loyal and protective but when my foster mom says that we are safe, I know I can immediately rest because we rely on trusting each other. My foster mom says I am a catch and that if she did not work 12 hour days at a health clinic, she would adopt me immediately because I am a one in a million, gentleman!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=6&searchType=4&animalid=208764","id":"295293da80ad0f5ccb1a691274cb9f94","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ba0ef16297054cceb16b70bc7b598e7f-1791140836-1791140850-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5e5d36b21c3f48f8a50403dfb66f6a56-1791140835-1791140835-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8ee6586aba0e42d99fec99fe2fa96c13-1791140835-1791140835-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/a8bca6557b51495c92f01897935d1f19-1791140834-1791140834-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4a9fc721e8974b878a3924705afde1f7-1791140833-1791140833-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/accb7e166e2a4604adb63c11e2cc79c6-1791140833-1791140833-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/af75c47c186a44c2914cdb9